<title>USA: Katmandu Entertainment IPO postponed - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Katmandu Entertainment IPO postponed - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public stock offering of Katmandu Entertainment Corp has been postponed, according to its underwriter National Securities Corp.</p>
<p>The company owns and operates a casual dining outdoor theme restaurant on the waterfront in Philadelphia open from mid-April through mid-September.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
